WEBVTT

00:00:15.068 --> 00:00:22.099
I'll never be easily loved...

00:00:22.276 --> 00:00:29.307
Am I just too clumsy?

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:36.515
That girl who looks good in pink...

00:00:37.157 --> 00:00:43.255
Is that who you want?

00:00:43.931 --> 00:00:47.890
Is red not good enough?

00:00:48.001 --> 00:00:54.907
The rabbit with red eyes runs away.

00:00:55.008 --> 00:01:02.313
Even though I loved you so much...

00:01:02.416 --> 00:01:10.415
If I'm sad, I'm going to die.

00:01:10.524 --> 00:01:17.362
The rabbit that you like...

00:01:17.698 --> 00:01:24.764
...isn't on the moon.
It's just a rabbit...

00:01:41.922 --> 00:01:43.481
Such use of color!

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:46.582
I can't even
comprehend the brushwork.

00:01:46.693 --> 00:01:52.029
| had heard the rumors, but foreign
art has become so advanced...

00:01:52.532 --> 00:01:54.227
It's the shogun's secret police!

00:01:54.501 --> 00:01:55.468
Run!

00:02:05.245 --> 00:02:08.340
Hand over the contraband.

00:02:08.548 --> 00:02:10.846
T-That voice...

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:18.956
You said we were comrades...

00:02:19.059 --> 00:02:21.551
You're just a dog of the shogunate...

00:02:35.008 --> 00:02:36.806
Magnificent...

00:02:37.811 --> 00:02:38.821
Genius

00:02:38.845 --> 00:02:41.371
Pickled vegetables

00:02:48.955 --> 00:02:51.617
You're going to get
another bodyguard?

00:02:52.092 --> 00:02:54.823
I realized when
we fought Kuroi Sabato.

00:02:55.595 --> 00:02:59.122
The swordsmen of the Itto-ryu
aren't just normal people.

00:03:07.641 --> 00:03:13.307
Manji, you're strong and you can't die,
so I feel like I can rely on you...

00:03:13.413 --> 00:03:16.644
...but I think it'd be
better to get more help.

00:03:18.251 --> 00:03:19.582
Hey, one more!

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:29.825
Do you have any idea
where you'll find this bodyguard?

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:33.127
I finally found the person
I've been searching for.

00:04:16.042 --> 00:04:17.305
Father.

00:04:21.615 --> 00:04:23.083
We have guests.

00:04:27.454 --> 00:04:29.149
Painting is nice and all...

00:04:29.256 --> 00:04:33.716
...but I'm the one who has to clean up
and apologize to the landlord.

00:04:34.161 --> 00:04:35.253
I'm sorry.

00:04:38.365 --> 00:04:39.855
Master Sori.

00:04:41.067 --> 00:04:42.364
Um...

00:04:44.371 --> 00:04:46.203
Could it be you, Rin?

00:04:46.306 --> 00:04:50.868
Yes, it's been a while.
Otatsu, how have you been?

00:04:50.977 --> 00:04:52.411
I've been well.

00:04:52.512 --> 00:04:54.674
Wow, you're all grown up!

00:04:54.781 --> 00:04:55.748
Hey.

00:04:56.983 --> 00:04:59.384
What are we doing?
Going door to door?

00:04:59.486 --> 00:05:04.390
Isn't he just a painter? He doesn't
look like a great swordsman to me.

00:05:05.192 --> 00:05:09.720
That coming from someone who looks
like he was abandoned on Mt. Takao...

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:16.361
...then raised by kind monkeys,
and just recently rejoined society.

00:05:19.539 --> 00:05:22.941
This person is my bodyguard,
sort of an assistant...

00:05:23.043 --> 00:05:24.841
That kind of person.

00:05:26.012 --> 00:05:27.639
What's all this about?

00:05:46.499 --> 00:05:47.660
Is that so...

00:05:49.369 --> 00:05:51.303
Asano is dead...

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:57.401
We've known each other
since we were kids.

00:05:57.510 --> 00:06:00.673
I'm sorry.
| had wanted to tell you sooner.

00:06:01.281 --> 00:06:04.376
No, I'm the one who should apologize.

00:06:04.484 --> 00:06:07.784
| wasn't even able
to attend the funeral.

00:06:07.888 --> 00:06:12.553
It's all right. That's only the beginning.

00:06:14.895 --> 00:06:16.556
Revenge?

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.595
An inexperienced
young woman like you?

00:06:23.703 --> 00:06:26.832
| don't want you
to go off to your death.

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:30.638
| understand how you feel,
but it's a foolish dream.

00:06:30.744 --> 00:06:32.576
I'm not dreaming.

00:06:34.414 --> 00:06:38.180
I've heard rumors
about this Anotsu guy.

00:06:38.985 --> 00:06:44.014
They say he's
a twenty-two-year-old genius swordsman.

00:06:44.124 --> 00:06:47.287
Even if you've hired
a bodyguard or an assistant...

00:06:47.394 --> 00:06:49.692
Um, was it Hanji?

00:06:49.796 --> 00:06:51.264
It's Manji!

00:06:51.498 --> 00:06:54.695
You think just hiring
him will be enough?

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:58.964
You may be right about that.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:04.343
But what if I had
more than one bodyguard?

00:07:05.312 --> 00:07:08.338
What do you mean by that?

00:07:08.815 --> 00:07:10.960
Father, it's the Nagasaki store owner.

00:07:10.984 --> 00:07:13.078
Father, it's the Nagasaki store owner.
Oh, you had guests over?

00:07:13.753 --> 00:07:15.187
Not quite.

00:07:15.789 --> 00:07:17.587
We'll finish this later.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.827
I'm sorry for troubling you
to come all the way here.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:29.127
Is something the matter?

00:07:30.103 --> 00:07:31.662
No, nothing.

00:07:43.283 --> 00:07:44.842
That's her, huh?

00:07:57.864 --> 00:08:02.358
So as I've explained, I haven't
been able to find the right color...

00:08:02.469 --> 00:08:05.928
...to finish this painting
to my satisfaction.

00:08:06.339 --> 00:08:08.865
Then why don't you leave it for now.

00:08:10.443 --> 00:08:13.435
Could I get you to paint another piece?

00:08:20.553 --> 00:08:23.181
Are you really going to do it, Rin?

00:08:27.794 --> 00:08:29.228
I'm going now.

00:08:44.844 --> 00:08:46.812
Thanks for your help.

00:09:01.995 --> 00:09:03.190
Master...

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:06.793
Just a little while longer,
so please keep still.

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:10.399
Won't you please
lend your strength to me?

00:09:10.837 --> 00:09:12.134
Strength?

00:09:12.772 --> 00:09:15.503
As you can see, I'm just an artist.

00:09:16.376 --> 00:09:20.438
I'm not asking an artist for his help.

00:09:21.815 --> 00:09:24.648
I'm asking one of
the shogun's secret police.

00:09:30.423 --> 00:09:31.788
You knew?

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:36.488
Yes, my father told me.

00:09:38.798 --> 00:09:42.496
Asano, you troublemaker...

00:09:43.369 --> 00:09:49.240
| heard you were chosen because of
your contacts and skill with the sword.

00:09:50.577 --> 00:09:54.104
And that your sword
skill surpassed my father's.

00:09:55.215 --> 00:09:58.515
Please, Master, take up your sword.

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:12.664
Artists, you know, if not
stimulated by something new...

00:10:12.765 --> 00:10:15.735
...their talent and their minds get rusty.

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:19.632
For me, that stimulation...

00:10:25.345 --> 00:10:27.712
...was western paintings.

00:10:28.681 --> 00:10:30.410
But in this day and age...

00:10:30.517 --> 00:10:34.852
...If one tried to collect such things,
the authorities would be at your back.

00:10:34.954 --> 00:10:41.223
So that's when I thought of becoming
one of the authorities myself.

00:10:44.097 --> 00:10:47.260
To join the shogunate,
| honed my sword skills...

00:10:47.367 --> 00:10:50.598
...and traveled the country
gathering intelligence.

00:10:51.104 --> 00:10:55.974
I've killed anti-shogunate dissidents
on the orders of the council of elders.

00:10:57.544 --> 00:11:00.377
I've killed even my own fellow artists.

00:11:02.248 --> 00:11:03.875
That's horrible...

00:11:07.353 --> 00:11:12.189
The soul possessed by the arts
will surpass mundane knowledge...

00:11:12.292 --> 00:11:14.784
...and pursue new values.

00:11:15.895 --> 00:11:18.887
No matter the sacrifices
that must be made.

00:11:24.637 --> 00:11:27.402
I've dragged
my sword through the mud.

00:11:28.208 --> 00:11:31.872
| couldn't allow such a blade
to help you on your journey.

00:11:35.848 --> 00:11:37.509
Why do you laugh?

00:11:37.617 --> 00:11:40.416
Let's be honest, Master.

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:45.118
You make a lot of excuses,
but when it comes down to it...

00:11:45.225 --> 00:11:48.160
...you just lived
at your own convenience.

00:11:48.628 --> 00:11:52.792
Instead of admitting what
kind of person you really are...

00:11:52.899 --> 00:11:56.164
...you're trying to convince
yourself with your own excuses.

00:11:56.402 --> 00:11:59.702
And all that talk about the fine arts...

00:11:59.806 --> 00:12:02.070
It's nothing. Just bullshit.

00:12:02.909 --> 00:12:04.673
Don't make me laugh.

00:12:05.411 --> 00:12:06.674
Maniji...

00:12:07.981 --> 00:12:11.918
You're just not willing
to risk your life for another, right?

00:12:12.018 --> 00:12:14.316
| won't deny that.

00:12:15.154 --> 00:12:17.418
| can't die yet.

00:12:17.523 --> 00:12:20.823
I've got a mountain
of things left to paint.

00:12:20.927 --> 00:12:23.089
And I'm not ashamed.

00:12:23.997 --> 00:12:26.489
It's just how we artists are.

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:29.298
Oh, is that so?

00:12:29.402 --> 00:12:32.861
Then do whatever you want,
you grey-haired bastard.

00:12:34.774 --> 00:12:35.900
Manji!

00:12:42.048 --> 00:12:44.745
Stay over in Tatsu's room tonight.

00:12:44.851 --> 00:12:46.012
But...

00:12:46.119 --> 00:12:51.114
Don't worry about him. He's not
the type to leave you stranded.

00:12:52.191 --> 00:12:54.558
Well, that's just a hunch...

00:13:15.148 --> 00:13:16.081
Infinity.

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:18.078
Infinity.

00:13:36.102 --> 00:13:37.194
Rin.

00:13:38.071 --> 00:13:39.061
Rin.

00:13:39.172 --> 00:13:40.435
Wake up.

00:13:45.745 --> 00:13:47.076
Mother...

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:48.706
I'm home.

00:13:51.617 --> 00:13:54.985
I'm so sorry for coming
home late on your birthday.

00:13:56.055 --> 00:13:58.717
Rin, are you crying?

00:13:59.625 --> 00:14:01.923
| had a scary dream.

00:14:04.831 --> 00:14:07.357
But I'm so glad...

00:14:09.235 --> 00:14:11.533
...it was all a dream.

00:14:31.891 --> 00:14:33.859
You sure like to sleep.

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:37.419
Brats like you should sleep forever!

00:14:45.571 --> 00:14:48.836
You're pretty quick
on your feet, little lady.

00:14:52.745 --> 00:14:57.945
Oh, well. Butterflies are
more fun to catch when they run...

00:15:06.092 --> 00:15:07.287
Manji!

00:15:07.627 --> 00:15:08.958
Hi there.

00:15:09.128 --> 00:15:10.653
Now I get it.

00:15:10.763 --> 00:15:15.132
| knew old man Sabato would
never have lost to a chick like her.

00:15:15.234 --> 00:15:17.703
It all makes sense now.

00:15:19.572 --> 00:15:21.540
Okay, take his head.

00:15:22.175 --> 00:15:26.908
If we take care of him,
all of Sabato's followers will be ours.

00:15:27.013 --> 00:15:28.481
All of us?

00:15:28.581 --> 00:15:29.742
Of course.

00:15:29.849 --> 00:15:32.409
But it's against the Itto-ryu to...

00:15:33.085 --> 00:15:34.849
Winning is everything.

00:15:34.954 --> 00:15:37.150
What are you guys
rambling on about?

00:15:37.256 --> 00:15:40.487
Do it or run along home
and jerk yourselves off.

00:15:41.828 --> 00:15:43.796
Stop acting so tough!

00:15:44.197 --> 00:15:48.498
First of all, do you think you can
take us all out with one sword?

00:15:50.036 --> 00:15:51.504
I think I'll manage.

00:15:57.577 --> 00:16:00.171
Huh? That's coming from our house.

00:16:07.453 --> 00:16:09.888
This isn't the right color either...

00:16:12.191 --> 00:16:15.684
My chosen path of art
that I kept defending with words...

00:16:18.531 --> 00:16:20.090
Is this my all?

00:16:20.833 --> 00:16:23.131
Isn't there a sword somewhere?

00:16:23.236 --> 00:16:24.499
Wait, you bitch!

00:16:24.604 --> 00:16:25.881
You're not going anywhere!

00:16:25.905 --> 00:16:27.930
You're not going anywhere!
I'll play with you guys!

00:16:28.374 --> 00:16:29.500
Red...

00:16:29.909 --> 00:16:33.038
That's right. It's definitely red.

00:16:33.412 --> 00:16:37.940
A red I'm positive
I've seen a thousand times before...

00:16:41.187 --> 00:16:44.646
But what kind of red?
A flower? The sunset?

00:16:45.157 --> 00:16:47.319
No, those aren't it.

00:16:47.426 --> 00:16:51.454
Something just as primal.
The source of all red...

00:16:54.800 --> 00:17:00.068
It's easy to put into words,
but what kind of red is it?

00:17:00.773 --> 00:17:03.242
Oh, gods in heaven...

00:17:03.342 --> 00:17:06.835
Let the devil send me a sign!

00:17:26.799 --> 00:17:31.361
It's done!

00:17:32.104 --> 00:17:33.697
This is it!

00:17:33.806 --> 00:17:37.003
This is exactly
what I've been looking for!

00:17:37.109 --> 00:17:40.977
This is the primal red! With this color...

00:17:46.018 --> 00:17:47.144
Got him.

00:17:54.293 --> 00:17:56.261
What the hell is this?

00:17:57.530 --> 00:18:00.124
You're finally trapped, you fool.

00:18:00.933 --> 00:18:03.061
The barbs blend well with trees...

00:18:03.169 --> 00:18:08.198
...50 hotheaded idiots like you
think they're just pieces of bark.

00:18:08.341 --> 00:18:09.604
Manji!

00:18:10.776 --> 00:18:12.039
Stay back, Rin!

00:18:12.144 --> 00:18:14.135
I've got an idea.

00:18:14.747 --> 00:18:18.183
How about I slice that
girl up right before your eyes?

00:18:19.552 --> 00:18:21.179
Just you try it.

00:18:22.188 --> 00:18:23.519
That idiot...

00:18:24.323 --> 00:18:27.384
| didn't expect to get permission.

00:18:27.493 --> 00:18:28.790
Wait up, baldy!

00:18:33.299 --> 00:18:36.394
It's not nice to make
fun of people like that.

00:18:36.502 --> 00:18:37.799
Manji!

00:18:42.708 --> 00:18:44.836
Not bad for a brat.

00:18:58.858 --> 00:18:59.882
Rin!

00:19:15.207 --> 00:19:17.904
W-Who the hell did that?

00:19:21.147 --> 00:19:26.085
A person who treats art like
a doormat deserves to die.

00:19:37.963 --> 00:19:39.431
He's good.

00:19:39.532 --> 00:19:41.193
Y-Yeah.

00:19:45.871 --> 00:19:50.069
The only rule of the Itto-ryu
is to fight one on one.

00:19:51.043 --> 00:19:52.670
Those who disobey...

00:19:52.778 --> 00:19:53.722
Wait!

00:19:53.746 --> 00:19:55.908
Wait!
| swear we didn't...

00:20:10.496 --> 00:20:11.861
Is someone here?

00:20:11.964 --> 00:20:13.227
Right away!

00:20:15.234 --> 00:20:17.134
You don't look familiar.

00:20:17.236 --> 00:20:21.571
| accepted Sir Abayama's
offer and was granted access.

00:20:21.674 --> 00:20:26.077
My name is Makoto.
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:20:26.178 --> 00:20:28.875
Is that so. Then I'll leave it up to you.

00:20:28.981 --> 00:20:30.415
Yes, sir.

00:20:36.122 --> 00:20:38.523
I really don't understand it.

00:20:39.291 --> 00:20:43.853
You have nothing to do with the Asano
family, so why did you get involved?

00:20:43.963 --> 00:20:47.058
Even turning yourself
into a bloody mess.

00:20:48.634 --> 00:20:51.626
Yesterday you laughed at me.

00:20:52.104 --> 00:20:56.541
So what is it?
Do you get off on martyrdom?

00:20:57.576 --> 00:20:59.544
It's not like that.

00:21:00.045 --> 00:21:01.308
Then why?

00:21:07.586 --> 00:21:09.748
There isn't really a reason.

00:21:09.855 --> 00:21:13.314
You and me, we're the same animal.

00:21:14.527 --> 00:21:17.428
Perhaps there's also an art to killing.

00:21:19.198 --> 00:21:22.168
Don't compare us,
you grey-haired old man.

00:21:25.571 --> 00:21:27.130
There is no need to worry.

00:21:27.606 --> 00:21:30.974
I'll restore it,
and you'll have it in three days.

00:21:31.076 --> 00:21:35.673
However, I'll need
thirty gold ryo for painting supplies.

00:21:39.885 --> 00:21:43.515
| can't lend you my strength,
but I will buy all the corpses.

00:21:43.622 --> 00:21:44.919
Master...

00:21:49.195 --> 00:21:52.187
In the end,
we're the "same animal," huh?

00:21:52.298 --> 00:21:55.165
You're not very honest, are you?

00:21:58.437 --> 00:22:00.201
Take care, Rin!

00:22:01.273 --> 00:22:03.765
Thank you, Otatsu!

00:22:03.876 --> 00:22:06.937
Please take care of Rin, Ginji!

00:22:08.514 --> 00:22:12.542
That bastard, he still
couldn't remember my name?

00:22:12.952 --> 00:22:14.943
Let's go, Manji.

00:22:25.631 --> 00:22:31.502
Sadly, I awakened...

00:22:31.604 --> 00:22:39.443
Overflowing reality is just...

00:22:40.379 --> 00:22:45.442
...more of the empty lies.

00:22:49.488 --> 00:22:57.488
To be honest, I have
to get ready for the next one.

00:22:59.198 --> 00:23:05.228
The morning slides
in from the window.

00:23:05.537 --> 00:23:12.807
Regardless of what
I see, I remember.

00:23:12.912 --> 00:23:16.177
| remember...

00:23:16.282 --> 00:23:22.654
The unchanging wind always...

00:23:22.755 --> 00:23:29.058
...just said this as it passed by...

00:23:29.161 --> 00:23:37.161
"What's needed for
this endless journey?”

00:23:49.982 --> 00:23:52.952
Where should I go?

00:23:55.154 --> 00:23:56.588
Infinite Preview

00:24:08.100 --> 00:24:09.534
Prisoner
